      Display is showing burn in on some pixels.
    </div>

    <div id="faq-answer_element_3026324" data-collapse-target="content" class="answer collapse">
      <p>The display can have image burn in for any pixels left on over a long period of time - many days. Try to avoid having the display on constantly for that length of time.</p>
